      "content": "Monaco editor uses coding language name but codeviewer is passing the file extension.\nAdd the file name with extension as new editor property and pass it instead the \"language\"\nEditor will guess the language from file extension if language property has not been set like:\n\u00a0* js: javascript\n\u00a0* ts: typescript\n\u00a0* java: java\n....\n\n\nAdd a list of the most common coding languages",
